<title>USA: Armenia buys 62,927 T HRW wheat under PL-480 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Armenia buys 62,927 T HRW wheat under PL-480 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenia puchased 62,927 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the PL 480 program for shipment January 23 to February 6, the U.S. Agriculture Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>The wheat was purchased from Farmland Industries at a cost of $180.48 per tonne FOB, USDA said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7294))</p>
</text>
